// Camp events (ticket 1003, docs/design/supports.md "Rules: camp events"):
// short, optional, scripted scenes listed at camp once the story reaches
// their point. They give nothing (no points, stats or items). Loaded by
// trpg_content::camp; the rules are in trpg_core::camp.
//
// events: in the order camp lists them.
//   id        unique among camp events; the campaign remembers it once seen
//   title     the list's name for it (English; language packs translate it
//             under camp.<id>.title)
//   scene     the dialogue scene it plays
//   flags     optional: story flags that must all be set
//   battles   optional: battles (ids) that must all have been won
//   units     optional: characters (ids) who must all be in the army,
//             alive and recruited
// Which events exist and when is the story pipeline's decision
// (story-writing skill). The test files' event is in
// assets-test/data/camp.ron (ADR-0057).
(
    events: [],
)
